Package: AACclustMac
Type: Package
Title: Categorical Clustering Methods with Quality Index Evaluation for macOS
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-10-21
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive collection of categorical clustering methods optimized
    for macOS, including AAC (Alpha-19) algorithm in sequential, parallel (mclapply),
    and Rcpp variants, hierarchical methods (Ward, DIANA), density-based methods
    (DBSCAN, HDBSCAN), Spectral Clustering, and POP (Partitioning Around PAMoids).
    Includes Quality Index (QI) evaluation for categorical partitions and silhouette analysis.
    Uses native macOS parallelism via mclapply for optimal performance on multi-core Macs.
